flowchart LR
  %% =========================================================
  %% Apparel Intelligence - Tool-Centric Architecture Map
  %% Categorized into Frontend and Backend
  %% =========================================================

  %% ---- Visual theme ----
  classDef user fill:#FFF8E1,stroke:#B7791F,stroke-width:1.8,color:#4A2C00;
  classDef feCore fill:#E6FFFA,stroke:#0F766E,stroke-width:1.8,color:#083E3A;
  classDef feTool fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#1D4ED8,stroke-width:1.6,color:#0B2E77;
  classDef beCore fill:#ECFCCB,stroke:#4D7C0F,stroke-width:1.8,color:#2E4A0B;
  classDef beTool fill:#F0FDF4,stroke:#15803D,stroke-width:1.6,color:#14532D;
  classDef ai fill:#FFF1F2,stroke:#BE123C,stroke-width:1.8,color:#650B1E;
  classDef data fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#6D28D9,stroke-width:1.8,color:#3B0F7A;

  %% ---- Entry ----
  User[User / Browser]:::user

  %% ================= FRONTEND =================
  subgraph FRONTEND[Frontend Experience Layer]
    direction TB
    FEApp[App UI<br/>Wardrobe | Style | Buy Analyzer | Content | Chat]:::feCore
    React[React 18]:::feTool
    TS[TypeScript]:::feTool
    Vite[Vite Dev Server + Build]:::feTool
    Tailwind[TailwindCSS]:::feTool
    Fetch[API Client - fetch<br/>JSON + multipart/form-data]:::feTool

    FEApp --> React
    FEApp --> TS
    FEApp --> Tailwind
    FEApp --> Fetch
    React --> Vite
    TS --> Vite
  end

  %% ================= BACKEND =================
  subgraph BACKEND[Backend Intelligence Layer]
    direction TB
    API[FastAPI app.main<br/>CORS + static serving]:::beCore
    Uvicorn[Uvicorn ASGI runtime]:::beTool
    Routers[Routers<br/>health | wardrobe | recommend | purchase | social | media | assistant]:::beTool
    Schemas[Pydantic v2 schemas<br/>pydantic-settings config]:::beTool
    Services[Service layer<br/>recommendation + purchase logic + content generation]:::beTool
    Py[Python 3.11]:::beTool

    API --> Routers --> Schemas --> Services
    API --> Uvicorn
    Services --> Py
  end

  %% ================= AI + RETRIEVAL =================
  subgraph AISTACK[AI and Retrieval Tooling]
    direction TB
    Agents[PydanticAI agents<br/>typed orchestration]:::ai
    Gemini[Google Gemini via google-genai<br/>reasoning + script + media prompting]:::ai
    Retrieval[Local retrieval pipeline]:::data
    Emb[Embeddings service]:::data
    VStore[Local vector store<br/>NumPy cosine similarity]:::data
    StyleKB[Style KB + wardrobe corpus]:::data
    MediaTools[MoviePy + Pillow<br/>video and image post-processing]:::ai

    Agents --> Gemini
    Retrieval --> Emb --> VStore --> StyleKB
    Gemini --> MediaTools
  end

  %% ================= STORAGE =================
  subgraph STORAGE[Local Data and Artifacts]
    direction TB
    DataRoot[data/]:::data
    Uploads[data/uploads]:::data
    GenMedia[data/generated_media]:::data

    DataRoot --- Uploads
    DataRoot --- GenMedia
  end

  %% ---- Cross-layer flow ----
  User --> FEApp
  Fetch -->|HTTP| API
  Services --> Agents
  Services --> Retrieval
  Routers -->|ingest garment| Uploads
  API -->|serves files| Uploads
  API -->|serves files| GenMedia
  MediaTools -->|writes MP4/preview| GenMedia
